# Pairs with ActiveTenantValidated. The region catalog honours any asserted
# tenant without re-resolving it, so a caller enumerates another tenant's
# actionable region set.
MODULE: RegionsTrustAssertedTenant
TARGET: ActiveTenantValidated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the region catalog honours the asserted tenant without ITenantContextResolver
PERTURBS: CallRegions

--- FIND
        honoured == hdr # NoTenant /\ Resolve(c, hdr) = hdr
--- REPLACE
        honoured == hdr # NoTenant
--- END
